+#. Hades, value of setting "videoscreen.hadesdvtransport": the composer's picture in IPT-PQ-c2, as licensed players are reported to send it (an expert choice); also on the Dolby Vision page of the player information; the core string #39898
 msgctxt "#32006"
 msgid "As licensed players send (IPT)"
 msgstr "Como envían los reproductores con licencia (IPT)"
